## 快速开始

```bash
# 安装依赖
pip install akshare pandas requests

# 运行盘前
python agents/premarket_agent.py

# 运行尾盘选股
python scripts/aana_afternoon_screen.py

# 运行复盘
python agents/postmarket_agent.py
```

